WEBVTT

00:11:01.204 --> 00:11:05.579
Coming just as we are
when we're the first,

00:11:05.621 --> 00:11:08.829
the only, the different or one of the few

00:11:08.871 --> 00:11:11.662
can prove too risky.

00:11:13.579 --> 00:11:16.329
So we wear the costume.

00:11:17.954 --> 00:11:20.329
We keep the truer parts
of ourselves hidden.

00:11:20.371 --> 00:11:23.329
We straighten our curly hair
for interviews.

00:11:23.371 --> 00:11:27.204
We pick up hobbies we do not enjoy.

00:11:27.246 --> 00:11:31.787
We restate our directives
as optional suggestions.